### Case-Insensitive Search Variant

```cpp
int FindColumnByLabelCI(wxGrid* grid, const wxString& label)
{
    for (int col = 0; col < grid->GetNumberCols(); col++)
    {
        if (grid->GetColLabelValue(col).IsSameAs(label, false)) // false = case-insensitive
            return col;
    }
    return -1;
}
